Verify or validate a model, test a mechanism or hypothesis, or assess agreement with evidence.`")
        P("`**Application**
Use, adapt, or extend the paper's model, mechanism, or method for my own scientific question.`")

        R ~~~ A ~~~ P
    end

    subgraph S2["Stage 2 — What depth of work do I need?"]
        direction LR

        M("`**Model Level**
Implement, adapt, or check the required computational model or method.`")
        C("`**Claim Level**
Test a selected scientific claim, proposed mechanism, or hypothesis.`")
        D("`**Result Level**
Reproduce, compare, or generate specific curves, tables, or numerical results.`")

        M ~~~ C ~~~ D
    end

    S1 --> S2

